PluginExternalValue.libraryName.summary.text:
库的名称。与 https://webpack.js.org/configuration/externals/#string 相同。

默认情况下，库名称与 externals 的 key 相同。例如：

配置

```js
ExternalsLoadingPlugin({
  externals: {
    lodash: {
      url: '……',
    }
  }
})
```

将生成以下 webpack externals 配置：

```js
externals: {
  lodash: 'lynx[Symbol.for("__LYNX_EXTERNAL_GLOBAL__")].lodash',
}
```

如果一个 external bundle 包含多个模块，应设置相同的库名称，以确保它只被加载一次。例如：

```js
ExternalsLoadingPlugin({
  externals: {
    lodash: {
      libraryName: 'Lodash',
      url: '……',
    },
    'lodash-es': {
      libraryName: 'Lodash',
      url: '……',
    }
  }
})
```

将生成以下 webpack externals 配置：

```js
externals: {
  lodash: 'lynx[Symbol.for("__LYNX_EXTERNAL_GLOBAL__")].Lodash',
  'lodash-es': 'lynx[Symbol.for("__LYNX_EXTERNAL_GLOBAL__")].Lodash',
}
```

可以传入数组来指定 external 的子路径。与 https://webpack.js.org/configuration/externals/#string-1 相同。例如：

```js
ExternalsLoadingPlugin({
  externals: {
    preact: {
      libraryName: ['ReactLynx', 'Preact'],
      url: '……',
    },
  }
})
```

将生成以下 webpack externals 配置：

```js
externals: {
  preact: 'lynx[Symbol.for("__LYNX_EXTERNAL_GLOBAL__")].ReactLynx.Preact',
}
```

pluginExternalBundle.example.0.text:
```ts
// lynx.config.ts
import { pluginExternalBundle } from '@lynx-js/external-bundle-rsbuild-plugin'
import { pluginReactLynx } from '@lynx-js/react-rsbuild-plugin'

export default {
  plugins: [
    pluginReactLynx(),
    pluginExternalBundle({
      externals: {
        lodash: {
          bundlePath: 'lodash.lynx.bundle',
          background: { sectionPath: 'background' },
          mainThread: { sectionPath: 'mainThread' },
        },
      },
    }),
  ],
}
```
